  "ingredients": [
    "4 cups chopped fresh tomatoes",
    "2 cups chicken broth",
    "4 cloves garlic",
    "1 slice onion",
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "2 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "2 teaspoons white sugar, or to taste",
    "1 teaspoon salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6Nqy8GC1e83bAlcxJeLmaHGD9cM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/39544-garden-fresh-tomato-soup-DDMFS-Step1-26d4de860c0b4b37ab472f556513a8fc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/39544/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine tomatoes, chicken broth, garlic cloves, and a large slice of onion in a stockpot over medium heat. Bring to a boil, and gently simmer for about 15 to 20 minutes to blend flavors.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/N7rp0WCgHEk6D8wqD__2hFknxjM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/39544-Garden-Fresh-Tomato-Soup-mfs-STEPS-006-515e296a86d24ef7982ef7a95ac974a8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/39544/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from heat and run the mixture through a food mill into a large bowl, or pan. Discard any stuff left over in the food mill.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WRT_G2IYirn7Q7spNgEW7sekngI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/39544-Garden-Fresh-Tomato-Soup-mfs-STEPS-009-d8d3b8db63d84da18ff077fce292eb8b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/39544/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter over medium heat in the now empty stockpot. Stir in flour to make a roux by cooking, whisking constantly, until mixture turns medium brown.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xR7mlack_LCo_zdmfFeBIqW_lMk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/39544-Garden-Fresh-Tomato-Soup-mfs-STEPS-013-34c9336b5680408eacb78369d0e01915.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/39544/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gradually whisk in a bit of the tomato mixture to prevent lumps from forming, then stir in the rest.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FtC1ZbGtC2VCFmjVTWT1IZbfFf4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/39544-Garden-Fresh-Tomato-Soup-mfs-STEPS-014-7346717c62694ed89910d08085113ae8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/39544/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season with sugar and salt to taste.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5LY2T2uyFaEIcQTwLHIS04dYWzo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/39544-Garden-Fresh-Tomato-Soup-mfs-STEPS-019-56be3efc853a4983803eb0031961b008.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/39544/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
